Package: cogitem
Type: Package
Title: Rule-Based Automatic Generation of Raven-Like Matrix Items
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: person("Mehmet Cahit", "Marangoz", email = "cahitgs@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates Raven-like 3x3 figural matrix items from an explicit
    item model: a figural carrier (15 shape families) crossed with a relational
    rule (constant, distribution of two or three, two-axis progression,
    rotation, mirror, figure addition, subtraction and multiplication, and the
    bitwise logic rules AND, OR, XOR and XNOR). The response options of every
    item are checked for distinctness with symmetry-aware symbolic signatures
    and explicit design constraints on count, size, stroke-width, rotation
    and colour differences (an experimental image-similarity screen is
    optional); generation is seeded and
    reproducible, and every item carries a design-feature record that serves
    as a Q-matrix in linear logistic test model (LLTM) analyses. Items are
    drawn with 'grid' and
    administered in a bundled 'shiny' application that logs responses,
    response times and hover traces.
